<title>USA: GE Capital buys Czech Republic's Multiservis.</title>
<headline>GE Capital buys Czech Republic's Multiservis.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>GE Capital Services said on Tuesday it acquired Multiservis AS, a retailer sales finance company in the Czech Republic, for undislosed terms.</p>
<p>Multiservis provides financing services to support independent electrical retail outlets in the Czech Republic, through its network of seven regional distribution centers.</p>
<p>As part of GE Capital Services, Multiservis would retain its own name and identity, the company said.</p>
<p>GE Capital is a unit of General Electric Co.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
